      "text": "{\\rtf1\\fbidis\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\nouicompat\\deflang2057{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil Segoe UI Variable;}}\r\n{\\colortbl ;\\red255\\green255\\blue255;}\r\n{\\*\\generator Riched20 3.2.0000}\\viewkind4\\uc1 \r\n\\pard\\tx720\\cf1\\f0\\fs21 The palace burned for three days. By the time the smoke cleared, the king was dead, the crown was missing, and the only witness was a girl who refused to speak.\\par\r\n}\r\n\u0000",
      "notes": "Establish the inciting event without over-explaining. Reader should feel dread, not know facts yet. Revisit pacing — might be too slow in the middle paragraph.",
