    {
      "id": "ch-001",
      "name": "Chapter 1 – The Courier",
      "text": "Sable had delivered bad news before, but never to a queen regent still holding a funeral wreath.",
      "lastCaretPosition": 1842,
      "lastVerticalOffset": 430.0,
      "notes": "Introduce Sable's voice early — dry, observational, slightly cynical. The wreath detail is good, keep it. Need a stronger beat at the end of the scene.",
      "synopsis": "Courier Sable arrives at the regency court with a sealed letter that implicates the High Steward in the king's death. Queen Regent Lena refuses to open it publicly.",
